      "content": "i know there are people who want to help, but it doesn't change anything. it's just more noise. the silence is the only thing that feels real. i feel like i'm just existing, not actually living. it's like i'm already a ghost in this house. i just miss him so much it hurts to even breathe sometimes. does it ever actually get better? or are we just supposed to keep hurting forever?",
